| T4-P0-05 | 单测 `tests/test_mamba_block.py`、`tests/test_lif_spike.py`、`tests/test_hybrid_block.py`：与参考实现/数学定义对齐 | 三套单测全绿，覆盖 ≥ 80% | 1.5 | T4-P0-04 |
